cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RateXp: Drop-in feedback collection for agentic skills"
message: "If you use RateXp, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Hikmet
    family-names: Beyoglu
    email: hikmet.beyoglu@hotmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/HikmetB1/RateXp"
url: "https://github.com/HikmetB1/RateXp"
abstract: >-
  RateXp is a feedback collection solution for agentic work. The end user of a
  coding agent, such as Claude Code or Cursor, installs it once and rates the
  whole session, or any skill's most recent run, right where the work happened.
  That keeps them close to their coding agent admin or skill author: the rating,
  and with consent the full conversation with personal information redacted,
  reaches those people on a live dashboard.
keywords:
  - agentic skills
  - feedback
  - dashboard
  - LLM
  - evaluation
license-url: "https://github.com/HikmetB1/RateXp/blob/main/LICENSE"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-06-15"
